cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MedAgentRx, please cite it as below."
title: "MedAgentRx: an executable change control plan for self-improving medical AI"
abstract: >-
  MedAgentRx checks every update to a clinical prediction model, whether made by an
  engineer, a pipeline or an AI agent, against its approved change plan (FDA PCCP,
  EU AI Act Art. 43(4)), and returns one verdict: ACCEPTED, FAILED or OUTSIDE_PLAN.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hemedan
    given-names: Ahmed
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/a7med7emedan/medagentrx"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
keywords:
  - predetermined change control plan
  - pccp
  - medical device software
  - eu-ai-act
  - ai-agents
  - model-governance
  - non-inferiority
